From: Sid Jain <sid_26@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve handle ownership and ready-seek continuation

Release the registry borrow before borrowing an instance and keep its Rc alive
for each guard. Conflicting access returns None; removal cannot silently leak
registered handles. Poll ready seeks without suspension setup, preserving
exit checks, work/signal ordering, and the same pinned future after Pending.
The shared seek-offset fix and wake-retaining block_on already exist upstream.

